  "description": "*“Hey, editor. I have a scene in my head. Should I try it?”* \n\nI tried to keep it dry because it was just a show, but he was too hot. He blurted out that he would be able to write without any problems if he just tried it before penetration before sex and left. In contrast to his plain reaction, Dasulgi’s body got all heated up and she secretly masturbated. Then, when she raised her head because of a strange feeling, she saw him leaning against the wall and looking directly at the scene. She was caught, as an editor, masturbating while calling the writer’s name. He leaned against the wall and quietly watched her, then leisurely asked, “Should I help you?”\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Dongjeongnam Danpyeonseon (동정남 단편선) Collection.*",
